{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415809","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415809","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041580901:0":{"text":"ふん……","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog18>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650EA8D21D4E9D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580902:0":{"text":"陛下、何かお悩みですか？お力になれることがあれば、何なりとお申し付けください。","source_cn":"陛下，是什么事惹您烦扰？属下愿意替您分忧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02C3E14ACC3480A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580903:0":{"text":"お前に任せられることはない。","source_cn":"只怕你帮不上忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259FB6FF0D8D26BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580904:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません。この私が至らぬばかりに……","source_cn":"是属下无能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D3BDD1842FDFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580905:0":{"text":"お前が無能なのではない。国政は、他人には任せられぬ。","source_cn":"不是你无能，而是治理国家之事，无法假手他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1973C70F12F167C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580906:0":{"text":"たとえそれが、余に最も忠実なるお前だとしてもな。","source_cn":"即便那个人是你，我最忠诚的禁卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB78B371CB99A1BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580907:0":{"text":"もう二度と、陛下を裏切る者は現れません。万が一いたとしても、私が真っ先にこの手で始末いたします。","source_cn":"绝对不会再有人敢背叛您，陛下。即便真有胆大妄为的家伙，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47E70849644AC849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580908:0":{"text":"お前の忠義を疑ったことはない、グリーズル。","source_cn":"我从不怀疑你的忠心，格瑞泽尔勒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA561BCC7D35757","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580909:0":{"text":"だが、いつの世も信頼とは得がたいものだ。それはグレイヴボーン相手でも変わらぬ。","source_cn":"但信任是一件奢侈的东西。即使如今我面对的是亡灵，也一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD90DB83B7B4ECD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580910:0":{"text":"権力と欲望は、生者も死者も等しく蝕む。ならば、これ以上危険を冒す必要もあるまい。","source_cn":"活人和死人都会被权利和欲望侵染，没必要再冒这个险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89595D7ACCFED20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580911:0":{"text":"陛下のお言葉、しかと心に刻みました。","source_cn":"属下会牢记您的教诲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354104D9856EE6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580912:0":{"text":"このグリーズル、決して陛下から賜ったご信頼を裏切りません。","source_cn":"陛下对我的信任，属下也一直铭记于心，永远都不会辜负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE803F17F567BE8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580913:0":{"text":"陛下のため、バンティスのため、陛下に忠実な魂をさらに集めて、陛下だけに忠誠を誓うグレイヴボーンの大軍を築いてみせます！","source_cn":"为了陛下，为了班题斯，属下必定竭尽全力为您搜罗更多忠诚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198DD65D1E377A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580914:0":{"text":"エスペリアはいずれ必ず、陛下の掌中に落ちることでしょう！","source_cn":"伊索米亚，终有一日会成为您的囊中之物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C11352A3EAF8036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580915:0":{"text":"その誓い、忘れるでないぞ。","source_cn":"记住你的许诺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E709825580A355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:托安":{"text":"トーラン","source":"托安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"グリーズル","source":"格瑞泽尔勒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"locali